# landfall, Ashen Basin (sys_25), 207 fuel from the player's (beyond the
# starting 200), so debug travel jumps there; the jump itself takes the star
# date to 69, so the brood has grown into a hive (stage 2, pop 22) by
# arrival. Beam one colonist down and land: the presence is built onto the level (the
# hive_core resin chamber, crawlers and fliers at its tier, eggs, the Resin
# Spire launcher). From orbit the hive is seen, and with it the egg it fired
# about day 57, drawn on the Star Map (Locate) in flight toward its target.
# Frame the hive with debug faction walk and look.
